{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1423.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7ee439c54786a6e189233dcd7b19271334e0d49a7b874a8dbf02c5b97fa74bb4","ja":"真珠星ちゃんと同じ、\n3倍のスペシャルレッスンが待ってますよ～。","zh":"和真珠星一样，\n3倍的特别练习在等着你哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
